        {
          "exampleId": "w:fit#e-eaa8822c0a33e186",
          "text": "“And the reason they got so much stronger and fitter was that their hearts could now fill a lot better and pump (泵送) a lot more blood during exercise.” But the hearts of those who participated in less intense exercise didn’t change, he says.",
